<title>ITALY: SOCCER-JUVENTUS 2 ROSENBORG 0 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JUVENTUS 2 ROSENBORG 0 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juventus of Italy beat Rosenborg of Norway 2-0 (halftime 1-0) in their European Cup quarter-final second leg on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Zinedine Zidane 29, Nicola Amoruso 88 pen</p>
<p>Juventus win 3-1 on aggregate</p>
</text>
